# The section 7 audit package must be readable from a plain `git clone` and
# from GitHub's "Download ZIP", neither of which resolves Git LFS. Stored as
# ordinary blobs, this overrides `*.png filter=lfs` in generator/.gitattributes
# for this directory and below (reference/ and search/).
#
# Cost: ~34 MB in the pack. That is the price of a judge being able to open
# contact_sheet.png and the 40 pair images without git-lfs installed. The
# builder (scripts/build_submission_zip.py) also refuses to write a ZIP
# containing LFS pointers, but that guard only protects the ZIP -- this
# protects the repository itself.
*.png !filter !diff !merge -text
